# Applies to the build context (repo root) when building docker/Dockerfile — BuildKit picks up
# a Dockerfile-specific ignore file named `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` automatically, so this can
# live in docker/ alongside the Dockerfile rather than needing a root-level .dockerignore.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.user
.git/
.claude/
docker/.env
